 # Systemd manager tui
 .
 ![rust](https://img.shields.io/badge/Rust-000000?style=for-the-badge&logo=rust&logoColor=white)
 .
 A TUI application for managing systemd services.
 .
 This tool allows you to manage systemd services with ease. You can view logs,
 list services, view properties, edit unit files, and control their lifecycle:
 start, stop, restart, mask, unmask, enable, and disable using the D-Bus API. It
 also supports Vim-like navigation. It is possible to navigate between system
 and user units and choose to list only running services or all units.
 .
